        Description=N'Build muscle and lose fat with this Monday-Friday workout routine. Crush the gym throughout the work week & enjoy your weekends off with this workout split.', HeroImageUrl=N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-wide-image/workout/m-f-workout-routine-wide.jpg', IsSystemDefault=1, SortOrder=1006,
        RecommendedGoal=N'BuildMuscle', Visibility=N'Public', SourceUrl=N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/workouts/m-f-workout-routine',
