    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Low Carb, High Protein Breakfast Pizza Eggs Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Pizza for breakfast (especially cold pizza!) is an American favorite. But it''s not always a waistline favorite! Now you can enjoy all the flavors of pizza in a healthy, low-carb version!', 238, 30, 10, 9, NULL, 1, 10036, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/low-carb-high-protein-breakfast-pizza-eggs', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/low-carb-high-protein-breakfast-pizza-featured.jpg', N'Enjoy hot or cook it the night before and have it cold for breakfast the next day - American style! Serves 1.', N'Coat a 9 inch skillet with nonstick spray Whisk together egg, egg whites, zucchini, coconut flour and pizza seasoning Pour mixutre into pan and set over medium heat Cover pan and allow to cook until eggs are set and edges become slightly golden Top with pasta sauce and grated cheese Notes You can add more eggs/egg whites to fit your macros Feel free to top with ground turkey breast or turkey pepperoni for added protein Add more or less cheese as desired. Fresh mozzarella would be wonderful!', N'["High Protein Recipes","Low Carb Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"238","protein_g":"30.3","carbs_g":"10.5","fat_g":"9.4"}', 54000);
