    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Protein Packed Sweet Potato Shepherds Pie', N'Dinner', N'Nothing says comfort like Shepherd''s Pie, and this savory recipe is a great way to get your dose of protein in without breaking your diet!', 428, 53, 36, 9, NULL, 1, 10037, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/protein-sweet-potato-shepherds-pie', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/shepherds_pie.jpg', N'Makes 4 Servings.', N'Preheat oven to 375 degrees Add ground beef to a non stick skillet Cook over medium heat Once cooked, add in tomato paste, frozen veggies and seasonings as desired Place mixture into a 9x13in oven safe dish Spread mashed sweet potatoes over top Sprinkle with paprika, if desired Bake for ~35-40 minutes Serve immediately Notes * Ground beef can be swapped for ground turkey breast, ground chicken breast or your favorite vegetarian/vegan protein source ** Frozen, all natural mashed sweet potatoes were used in this recipe. If buying frozen mashed potatoes, please check label as they could contain added salt and fat.', N'["High Protein Recipes","Dinner Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"428","protein_g":"53","carbs_g":"36","fat_g":"9"}', 51200);
