    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Chewy Snickerdoodle Protein Cookies Recipe', N'Snack', N'Soft, chewy and packed with protein, these simple Snickerdoodle Cookies are the perfect holiday treat to satisfy your sweet tooth and keep your macros in check!', 91, 7, 10, 3, NULL, 1, 10054, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/chewy-high-protein-snickerdoodle-cookies', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/snickedoodle.jpg', N'Makes 10 cookies, 1 cookie = 1 serving. Macros leave you plenty of room to enjoy 2 or 3!', N'Sift together coconut flour, protein powder, baking powder and salt Whisk together melted coconut oil, egg, vanilla and honey Combine wet and dry ingredients Mix until just incorporated Cover and place in the refrigerator for 20 minutes Preheat oven to 325 degrees F Line a baking sheet with parchment paper In a small bowl mix together cinnamon and xylitol, if desired Shape dough into balls (about 1.5 tbs size) Roll in cinnamon/xylitol mixture, if using Place cookies on baking sheet Flatten cookie into desired shape Bake for ~10 minutes Remove from oven and allow to cool Notes: *If you do not have snickerdoodle protein powder, you can sub with vanilla + 2 tsp ground cinnamon', N'["High Protein Recipes","Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"91","protein_g":"7","carbs_g":"10","fat_g":"3"}', 42300);
