    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Chocolate Peanut Butter Protein Crepes Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Tired of the same oats and egg whites every morning for breakfast? Then you need to try this high protein chocolate peanut butter crepes recipe!', 314, 54, 16, 4, NULL, 1, 10078, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/chocolate-peanut-butter-crepes', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/chocolate-pb-create-feature.jpg', N'1/2 of recipe *Toppings are optional. **Macronutrient breakdown does not including optional toppings.', N'Whisk together eggwhites, protein powder and sweetener Coat a small skillet with non stick spray Place over medium heat Pour 1/6th of batter into pan Til pan to coat bottom (this should be very thing) Allow to cook ~2 minutes Remove from pan gently Repeat until all batter is gone In a bowl mix together yogurt and peanut powder (and sweetener, if desired) Place 2 tbs of yogurt into center of each crepe Roll up Top with a drizzle of chocolate peanut butter and peanut butter chips, if desired', N'["High Protein Recipes","Snack Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"314","protein_g":"54","carbs_g":"16","fat_g":"4"}', 30200);
END
