    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Protein Packed Lean Gains BBQ Sloppy Joe Recipe', N'Lunch', N'Give your normal winter comfort dish a summer, BBQ twist, and you have the perfect, protein packed dish to enjoy any time of year!', 407, 55, 28, 8, NULL, 1, 10088, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-bbq-sloppy-joe', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/bbq_sloppy_joe.jpg', N'Serves 1.', N'Heat a non stick skillet over medium heat Sauté your onion, ground beef and turkey until almost cooked through Add in your crushed tomatoes and seasonings Cook additional 2 minutes Serve over roll of choice Notes: *96/4% ground beef was used in this recipe. Feel free to use all ground turkey breast or any combination you would like. Please note this will alter macros listed. **Please note the carbohydrate content if using pasta sauce. ½ cup of crushed tomatoes contains approximately 7.5g carbs. This can significantly alter both the fat and carb macros. ****Make a double, triple or quadruple batch of the filling on Meal Prep Sunday to be enjoy over brown rice for a hearty meal or over sliced and roasted zucchini for a light and low carb dish!', N'["High Protein Recipes","Lunch Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"407","protein_g":"55.2","carbs_g":"28.1","fat_g":"7.8"}', 26300);
END
