 get firm they are ready to flip. Serve and enjoy, you can top with what you like. I do not use anything as the pancakes are sweet and taste perfect by themselves. Note: If you need or want added carbs you can add milk to the mix as well as if you need more protein you can add vanilla protein powder.', CategoriesJson=N'["Breakfast Recipes"]', SourceMacrosJson=N'{"calories_kcal":"460","protein_g":"25","carbs_g":"75","fat_g":"7"}', ReadCount=25500
    WHERE MealSuggestionId=@ImportedMealSuggestionId;
