    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'High-Protein Chicken & Peanut Black Bean Pasta Recipe', N'Lunch', N'Who said you can’t enjoy pasta with a super-charged side of protein? This savory dish is not only loaded with protein, but is also low in carbs and high in fiber, making it the perfect dish to satisfy your pasta craving!', 451, 46, 26, 18, NULL, 1, 10115, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-chicken-peanut-pasta', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/chick_peanut_feature.jpg', N'Serves 2.', N'Combine all dressing ingredients in a bowl. Heat in microwave for 30-45 seconds and mix well. Cook pasta according to directions. Toss cooked pasta, bean sprouts, shredded chicken, and dressing together. Evenly divide between 2 plates (or save half for a second meal!). Top pasta with roasted peanuts and fresh chives, if desired. Note: Using regular pasta will decrease the protein content and increase the carb content. Adjust according to your personal macros.', N'["High Protein Recipes","Lunch Recipes","Dinner Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"450.7","protein_g":"45.5","carbs_g":"26","fat_g":"18.3"}', 19200);
END
