    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Low Calorie Banana Bread Protein Muffins Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Satisfy your sweet tooth with this recipe for low calorie banana bread protein muffins. Goes great with a cup of coffee or for a late night snack.', 149, 8, 16, 8, NULL, 1, 10116, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/banana-bread-protein-muffins', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/banana-bread-protein-muffins.jpg', N'Makes 12 muffins.', N'Preheat oven to 375 degrees Line 12 muffin cups with paper liners of spray very well with non-stick spray Sift together dry ingredients In a second bowl, mix together wet ingredients Combine wet and dry ingredients Evenly divide batter between 12 muffin cups Bake for ~12 minutes Allow to cool before eating** Notes *You can lower carbs by swapping banana for applesauce, pumpkin, or greek yogurt **When baking with protein poweder, always under cook slightly and allow recipe to cool as the items will continue to set during this time. If overcooked, you will have rubbery muffins.', N'["Snack Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"149","protein_g":"8","carbs_g":"16","fat_g":"8"}', 19100);
END
