    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Strawberry Milk Chocolate Chip Protein Pancakes Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Power up your day with a huge stack of strawberry protein pancakes sweetened with sugar free milk chocolate!', 582, 55, 60, 16, NULL, 1, 10124, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/strawberry-milk-chocolate-chip-protein-pancakes', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/strawberry-milk-chocolate-chip-protein-pancakes-featured.jpg', N'Makes 1 giant serving packed with gains! (Or, split into 2 servings to share or save for a second meal.)', N'Whisk together oat flour, coconut flour, protein powder and baking powder In a second bowl, mix together egg whites, Greek yogurt, vanilla extract and sweetener (if using) Combine wet and dry ingredients Stir in 2 tbsp chopped milk chocolate Coat skillet with oil or non-stick spray Heat pan over medium heat Spoon batter into heated skillet Cook until small bubbles begin to form Flip and cook for an additional 1-1.5 minutes Repeat until all batter is cooked Melt remaining milk chocolate, if desired Drizzle over pancakes Finish off with sliced fresh strawberries', N'["High Protein Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"582","protein_g":"54.6","carbs_g":"59.8","fat_g":"15.6"}', 17900);
END
