    Title=N'Snickerdoodle Pecan Protein French Toast Sticks', MealType=N'Breakfast', Description=N'Wake up on the right side of the bed with this french toast sticks recipe! Full of protein, this tasty breakfast will help start your day on the right foot!', CaloriesKcal=348, ProteinG=40, CarbsG=29, FatsG=8,
