        (MealSuggestionId, Title, MealType, Description, CaloriesKcal, ProteinG, CarbsG, FatsG, SuggestedMonth, IsSystemDefault, SortOrder, SourceUrl, ImageUrl, ServingSuggestion, ContentText, CategoriesJson, SourceMacrosJson, ReadCount)
    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Easy Bake Chorizo & Veggie Quiche Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'This protein-packed breakfast dish is not only simple and tasty, but can be made ahead of time and stored in a sealed container for up to 3 days for a great grab n'' go breakfast!', 240, 19, 12, 13, NULL, 1, 10147, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/chorizo-veggie-quiche', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/cvq_feature.jpg', N'Makes 6 Large Quiche.', N'Preheat oven to 375 degrees. Coat 6 large muffin cups with nonstick spray.** Heat a skillet over medium heat. Cook chorizo, onion and shredded potato. In a bowl, whisk together eggs, egg whites, cottage cheese, salt & pepper. Add meat, onion, potato and broccoli to eggs. Evenly divide among 6 cups. Bake for 40-45 minutes. Allow to cool and then gently remove from mold. Notes: *Can sub with ground turkey breast if following a lower fat meal plan. If using ground turkey, add your favorite no salt seasoning to replace the flavor from the chorizo. **Can also use 12 regular size muffin cups. Use approximately half the cooking time.', N'["Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"239.6","protein_g":"18.6","carbs_g":"11.6","fat_g":"13.2"}', 15300);
END
