    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Half Pound Teriyaki Turkey Burger Recipe', N'Lunch', N'It''s time for a tropical vacation from your standard plain burger. Fire up the grill and give this sweet and tangy pineapple teriyaki burger a try!', 513, 63, 54, 5, NULL, 1, 10152, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/teriyaki-turkey-burger', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/teryaki-vurger-feature-1.jpg', N'Makes 2 servings', N'Mix together ground turkey breast and 2 tablespoons teriyaki sauce Heat grill to medium Place burgers on hot grill Grill for about 7-9 minutes, depending on desired temperature Flip and cook an additional 7-9 minutes While burgers are cooking on the second side, place pineapple rings on the grill and cook 2 minutes. Flip pineapple and grill an additional 2 minutes Layer roll with lettuce, half pound turkey burger, additional 1 tablespoon teriyaki sauce per burger and grilled pineapple Enjoy! Notes: *This recipe would also work well with ground beef or your favorite vegetarian protein source *This recipe can be made low carb by using a large lettuce leaf in place of the roll, reducing the overall carb macros by around 40g, depending on the brand of roll', N'["High Protein Recipes","Lunch Recipes","Dinner Recipes","BBQ/Grill Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"513","protein_g":"63","carbs_g":"54","fat_g":"5"}', 14800);
END
