    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Strawberry Protein Cheesecake Recipe', N'Snack', N'You can never go wrong with cheesecake - especially this strawberry one that will not only satisfy your sweets cravings, but keep your macros in line too!', 206, 25, 32, 2, NULL, 1, 10157, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/strawberry-protein-cheesecake', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/strawberry_cheesecake.jpg', N'Makes 6 servings.', N'Preheat oven to 325 degrees Line the bottom of a 6in spring form pan with parchment paper Spray pan with non stick spray Add cream cheese and xylitol to a bowl and mix using an electric hand mixer Add in 1 egg and continue to mix Add in second egg Mix Add in greek yogurt, vanilla extract and protein powder Mix Pour batter into pan and bake 30 minutes Reduce heat to 200 degrees and bake an additional ~45 minutes* Place in refrigerator for 6-8 hours or overnight to finish setting Top with strawberries and melted chocolate, if desired Notes: *Cheesecake will appear as if it is not set, however it will finish and set while chilling in the refrigerator. Do not over bake.', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"206","protein_g":"25","carbs_g":"32","fat_g":"2"}', 14000);
END
